& [Registration] is an explicit operator-owned configuration transition
  + readiness artifacts may describe and test the launch command but shall not perform registration
  + the server name is cantor-attention and shall be collision-free before registration
  + the command is a noninteractive SSH STDIO launch of the pinned EVO-X2 executable and config
  + registration and removal commands shall match both installed CLI help and official OpenAI documentation

& [InstructionSurface] is compact and self-contained
  + server initialization instructions state proposal-only authority, evidence verification, no automatic retry, and no llama invocation
  + the most important guidance fits within the first 512 characters
  + the sole exposed tool remains route_attention

& [TransportAcceptance] is the future Codex launch path
  + official RMCP client launches the server through ssh -T with the exact remote command and arguments
  + a positive call returns one independently verified selected route
  + a negative call returns one independently verified structured refusal
  + client closure leaves no persistent cantor-attention-mcp process

& [ConfigurationNoninterference] is observable
  + Codex MCP inventory before and after readiness proof is identical
  + no existing MCP entry is changed and no cantor-attention entry is created
  + existing llama.cpp PID and shared sop-agent hash remain unchanged

& [Acceptance] is measurable
  + [CAMR-001] source manifest and specification authority verify
  + [CAMR-002] official docs and installed CLI agree on add list and remove syntax
  + [CAMR-003] proposed name has no collision before or after proof
  + [CAMR-004] exact ssh -T transport passes selected and refused official-client probes
  + [CAMR-005] runbook records preflight registration restart verification removal and failure policy
  + [CAMR-006] configuration remote-process llama.cpp and shared-service noninterference pass

& [Signature] is bounded implementation authority
  + [signature_uuid] is 720cfd6b-b94a-4f95-a3dc-4a9f42639f1c
  + [source_manifest_sha256] is 7A81F6766D87661C2CEC5814288B6A23AC22CB3FAC941382038B1EE65AF039FB
  + [authority_scope] is readiness audit transport proof runbook evidence and closure without registration
  + [invalidation] is configuration mutation hidden retry persistent remote process or altered semantic authority
